<title>NEW ZEALAND: TrustPower yr profit up 46.9 percent.</title>
<headline>TrustPower yr profit up 46.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   16.36 vs 11.14</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Aug 29</p>
<p>Reg date Aug 8</p>
<p>Note - TrustPower Ltd is an electricity supplier.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
